  {
    "key": "catAge.scienceSection.title",
    "value": "The Science Behind Cat Aging"
  },
  {
    "key": "catAge.scienceSection.body",
    "value": "Cats age rapidly in their first 2 years of life — a 1-year-old cat is roughly equivalent to a 15-year-old human, and a 2-year-old cat is about 24 human years. After age 2, each cat year equals approximately 4 human years. This is based on the AAHA/AAFP Feline Life Stage Guidelines, which define six distinct life stages with different health and nutritional needs."
  },
